    <link:footnoteLink xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link" xlink:type="extended">
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-108" xlink:label="f-108_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-113" xlink:label="f-113_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-118" xlink:label="f-118_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-546" xlink:label="f-546_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-721" xlink:label="f-721_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:loc xlink:href="#f-1156" xlink:label="f-1156_lbl" xlink:type="locator" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-108_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-108_47101_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-113_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-113_47102_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-118_lbl" order="1" xlink:to="ft-118_47103_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-546_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-546_47293_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-721_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-721_47294_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1156_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1156_47398_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-108_47101_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Energy Transfer LP owns 100% of ET CC Holdings LLC.</p><p>ET CC Holdings LLC owns 87.7% of Permian Express Partners LLC.</p><p>ET CC Holdings LLC owns 60% and Permian Express Partners LLC owns 40% of Bakken Holdings Company LLC.</p><p>Bakken Holdings Company LLC owns 51% of Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC.</p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of ETCO Holdings LLC.</p><p>ETCO Holdings LLC owns 75% of Energy Transfer Crude Oil Company.<b></b></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-113_47102_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>MarEn Bakken Company LLC owns 49% of Bakken Pipeline Investments, LLC. </p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of ETCO Holdings, LLC.</p><p>ETCO Holdings, LLC owns 75% of Energy Transfer Crude Oil Company, LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-118_47103_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>Mid-Point Pipeline, LLC owns approx. 12.3% of Permian Express Partners LLC. </p><p>Permian Express Partners LLC owns 40% of Bakken Holdings Company LLC. </p><p>Bakken Holdings Company LLC owns 51% of Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC. </p><p>Bakken Pipeline Investments LLC owns 100% of ETCO Holdings, LLC. ETCO Holdings, LLC owns 75% of Energy Transfer Crude Oil Company, LLC.</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-546_47293_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Other Adjustments due to asset unitization </p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-721_47294_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Other Adjustments reflect an asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1156_47398_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model.This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings. </span><br /></p></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>